  ${GREEN}--pod-agent-issuer-url <url>${NC} / ${GREEN}--pod-agent-audience <url>${NC}  pod-agent trust (https)
  ${GREEN}--smtp-uri <uri>${NC}           SMTP relay for auth emails (SMTP_CONNECTION_URI)

${YELLOW}Non-interactive (--non-interactive):${NC}
  Nothing is ever prompted. Defaults: domain = --domain, else <--name>.${SYNAP_POD_ZONE}, else the
  existing deploy/.env; admin bootstrap = token (preseed only with --admin-email + --admin-password);
  an existing .env is kept; a failed migration aborts. With --register-token and no --email, the
  ACME contact defaults to ${SYNAP_ACME_EMAIL_DEFAULT}.

${YELLOW}Examples:${NC}
